	spec: `A completed model response supplies the full set of tool calls before dispatch. After the existing approval checks, EDIT calls in that round targeting the same canonical file and lease hash form one atomic operation. Combine their range lists and reuse existing EDIT validation, bottom-to-top application, lease checking and atomic writing. Reject the whole group without writing if any member is invalid or any ranges overlap, including after EOF clamping; do not introduce partial success. Calls against different files remain concurrent. Calls against different hashes, WRITE and BASH are not combined and retain their existing locking and execution behavior.

